- content_for :title, "Trending Projects"

.hero
  section.section: .container
    .columns: .column
      h2= content_for :title
      .description
        markdown:
          We are still collecting the download history that trends are calculated from.

          A project counts as trending when its download growth over the last four weeks
          exceeded the growth of the four weeks before that, so the first ranking can only
          appear once enough weekly snapshots have accumulated. Until then this page stays
          empty - nothing is broken, and there is nothing you need to do.

          In the meantime you can [browse the catalog by category](/categories), or read
          [how trends are calculated](/pages/docs/features/trending_projects).
